  "question": {
    "text": "A multiple choice examination has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;questions. Each question has three alternative answers out of which exactly one is correct. The probability that a student will get <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;or more correct answers just by guessing is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "2VjIq",
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msup> <mn>3</mn> <mn>5</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "mTyut",
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msup> <mn>3</mn> <mn>5</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "WLqa2",
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>7</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msup> <mn>3</mn> <mn>5</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "uILdA",
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msup> <mn>3</mn> <mn>5</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;or more correct answers means and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>or</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;wrong answers.<br />for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;wrong questions&nbsp; <math> <mrow> <msup> <mspace></mspace> <mn>5</mn> </msup> <msub> <mtext>C</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msup> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <msub> <mtext>C</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br />for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;wrong questions&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Hence favourable ways&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math><br /><br />Total ways of answering&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></math><br /><br />Hence probability = <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msup> <mn>3</mn> <mn>5</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
    "image": null
  },
